Readout
- The useful next table is not a larger scalar count.  It is the
  case_id -> first_missing_sidecar ledger above, run on actual HYP-2963
  coarse fibers.
- q=23/B18Z6 points first at endpoint_owner_strip.
- A000568/P(5)->U(6) points first at rootless_cycle_object.
- Desargues/Beal points first at girth-six incidence plus common owner.
- Multiple centers should be treated as value-origin ambiguity before
  they are treated as new residual debt.
